#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Given the behavior expected in the answer above, what distribution of magnetic particles would you expect to see on the screen?\n"
msgstr "上の答えで期待される振る舞いを踏まえると、画面上にどのような磁性粒子の分布が見られると期待しますか？\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
